#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""kayfabe - a terminal that looks like someone is working very hard.

Everything here is theater. It prints made-up commands and made-up output
(git, npm, docker, pytest, kubectl, terraform, vim, htop, stack traces...)
with realistic typing and timing. It never touches the network, never runs a
subprocess, never reads or writes files, and discards anything you type.

    ./kayfabe              run it (Ctrl+C to quit)
    ./kayfabe --speed 2    twice as fast (0.5 = slower)

Python 3.8+ standard library only, so it runs on any stock Mac.
"""
